# Create .gitignore using notepad
notepad .gitignore
```

When Notepad opens, **paste this content:**
```
# Environment variables
.env
.env.local

# API Keys
**/apikeys.js
config/secrets.json

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Node modules (if added later)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Docker
*.dockerignore

# Temporary files
*.tmp
temp/